# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree alike.
#
# The index was already LF everywhere - core.autocrlf normalises on the way
# in - but the checked-out files were CRLF on Windows, so a script that
# rewrites a whole file had to detect and preserve them, and one that forgot
# produced a diff of every line. This settles it in one place instead.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
